<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team about your experience travelling to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<b><i>If no space in overhead add:-</i></b><br />
<br />
We’ll always do our best for our customers.<br />
<br />
We strive to accommodate our customers’ needs, but there is a limited amount of storage on board, so we need to limit the amount of carry-on in the aircraft cabin.<br />
<br />
There are times when our crew will have to move items to another part of the cabin or ask customers to put any smaller items under the seat in front to make room. When this happens, we really appreciate our customer's understanding.</p>

<p><b><i>Inconsistency of Policy add:-</i></b></p>

<p><strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
We always strive to accommodate our customers’ needs, but there’s a limited amount of storage on board. This means we sometimes need to limit the amount of carry-on in the aircraft cabin. &nbsp;<br />
<br />
While there has been no change to our cabin baggage policy, we’ve asked our airport staff and cabin crew to be more vigilant in identifying oversize items to reduce injuries and help customers find adequate stowage on board.<br />
<br />
&nbsp;<em><strong>If staff were rude add:-</strong></em><br />
<br />
I'm sorry to learn that our staff weren't as courteous as expected.<br />
<br />
<b>We value your opinion</b><br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that I’ve passed your feedback on to our Airport Management to take up with the staff working on {{{Case.Email_Arrival_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
Thank you for telling us about your experience&nbsp;— we look forward to welcoming you on board again soon.</p>
</body>
